{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"499e501ccf4d5650","name":"card_unit_1st_texas_infantry","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/USA/Legions/units/card_unit_1st_texas_infantry","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"1st TEXAS INFANTRY","text":"Double attack and defense when you gain an extra kredit slot.","flavorText":"The 1st Texas Infantry, officially known as 141st Infantry Regiment, is a regiment of the US Army and traces its origin back to the Texas Revolution in 1836. They would later fight in the American Civil War for the Confederate States Army and in WWI. During WWII the regiment was assigned to the 36th Infantry Division of the US Army which fought several battles and campaigns on the Western Front, including the Italian Campaign, the Allied landings in Southern France, the Allied drive to the Rhine, and the push into Germany. The 1st Texas Infantry was first in doing several things. F.ex. it was among the first American troops to land in Europe, among the first Allied troops to enter Rome, the first infantry regiment to land on the coast of Southern France, and the first troops of the 36th Division to enter Germany.","faction":"USA","type":"infantry","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":3,"operationCost":2,"attack":1,"defense":1},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_1st_texas_infantry","title":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_1st_texas_infantry_title","SourceString":"1st TEXAS INFANTRY","LocalizedString":"1st TEXAS INFANTRY"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":1,"defense":1,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::USA","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_1st_texas_infantry_text","SourceString":"Double attack and defense when you gain an extra kredit slot.","LocalizedString":"Double attack and defense when you gain an extra kredit slot."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_1st_texas_infantry_history","SourceString":"The 1st Texas Infantry, officially known as 141st Infantry Regiment, 